     where _$_{___l_o_c_a_l_b_a_s_e_} is being set from within _/_u_s_r_/_s_b_i_n_/_p_e_r_i_o_d_i_c.

     To log ppeerriiooddiicc output instead of receiving it as email, add the follow‐
     ing lines to _/_e_t_c_/_p_e_r_i_o_d_i_c_._c_o_n_f:

